\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;(not possible)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Number of solutions are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
